# Delegated supervisor external interrupt smoke test.
# Host setup preloads:
# - controller source 1 enabled, routed to supervisor, and pending
# - privilege = User
# - mideleg/sie enable supervisor external interrupts
# - stvec = 0x20
# The supervisor handler claims source 1 from the controller, completes it,
# writes x10 = 5, returns with sret, and user mainline resumes at PC 0
# before spinning at PC 0x4.
# Expect x1 = 5, x10 = 5, scause = interrupt 9, sepc = 0, privilege = User.
